[agent:result] 311	### Timeout Behavior
[agent:result] 312	
[agent:result] 313	- Value `0` = no timeout (default)
[agent:result] 314	- When timeout exceeds, task/job is cancelled
[agent:result] 315	- Partial results may be lost
[agent:result] 316	- Triggers `on_failure` notifications
[agent:result] 317	
