[agent:result] 349	
[agent:result] 350	### Retry Parameters
[agent:result] 351	
[agent:result] 352	| Parameter | Default | Description |
[agent:result] 353	|-----------|---------|-------------|
[agent:result] 354	| `max_retries` | 0 | Number of retry attempts |
[agent:result] 355	| `min_retry_interval_millis` | 0 | Minimum wait between retries |
[agent:result] 356	| `retry_on_timeout` | false | Retry when task times out |
[agent:result] 357	
[agent:result] 358	### Retry Behavior
[agent:result] 359	
[agent:result] 360	- Retries only apply to task failures
[agent:result] 361	- Each retry is a new task attempt
[agent:result] 362	- Retry count resets for each job run
[agent:result] 363	- Dependencies wait for retries to complete
[agent:result] 364	
